Third-party material
--------------------

test-vectors/data/iso3166.json, and the copy of it each library bundles

  Country codes (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2) and selected subdivision codes
  (ISO 3166-2), extracted from the Debian iso-codes data
  (https://salsa.debian.org/iso-codes-team/iso-codes) as redistributed by
  pycountry 26.2.16 (https://pypi.org/project/pycountry/26.2.16/), copied
  unchanged from abiz-org/abiz-agentic-business-record.

  iso-codes and pycountry are distributed under the GNU Lesser General
  Public License, version 2.1
  (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.html).

  This material is not covered by the Apache License 2.0.

test-vectors/jcs.json (the first six cases)

  RFC 8785 test data from cyberphone/json-canonicalization
  (https://github.com/cyberphone/json-canonicalization), Apache License 2.0.

lib/abiz/schema.rb, the hostname format (this gem only)

  The JSON Schema format definitions it covers are ported from
  @cfworker/json-schema 4.1.1, src/format.ts
